DESCRIPTION:Pensacola Winterfest is a volunteer-run holiday event around t
 he Old County Courthouse in downtown Pensacola\, with snow falling on Pla
 za Wonderland and trolley tours themed on Peanuts\, The Polar Express and
  the Grinch\, plus a Scrooge and Marley tour in Christmas week. Each tour
  runs about 25 minutes. Snow and music in the plaza are free\, and photo 
 sessions with Santa are booked by the group. Reservations are strongly re
 commended because recent seasons sold out in advance.\nPrice: from $17\nA
 rea: Pensacola\nTimes: Fri 11/27 to Thu 12/24 · Fri to Sun evenings\, th
